# DS-0002 (no non-root USER in the Dockerfile) is accepted because:
#  * deploy/edge starts as root, installs the keytab as www-data, then Apache
#    drops its workers to www-data; the master must bind 8443 and read the
#    root-owned TLS key at startup;
#  * deploy/pi and tests images are always run with an explicit non-root
#    `user:` in compose.yaml (PI_UID:PI_GID), and pi-client additionally drops
#    all capabilities and has a read-only root filesystem.
DS-0002
